1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,220
I'm Christina Koch,

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:04,433
I'm a mission specialist
on the Artemis II mission to the moon.

3
00:00:04,433 --> 00:00:09,493
When I first found out that I was assigned
to Artemis II, my thoughts were disbelief,

4
00:00:09,493 --> 00:00:12,570
an immense sense of honor
and responsibility,

5
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:13,860
and readiness.

6
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,780
I'm ready to try to make everyone proud

7
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:19,567
and to really fulfill what this
mission truly means to all humanity.

8
00:00:19,567 --> 00:00:22,777
For me, there's never really been a time
when I didn't want to be an astronaut.

9
00:00:22,777 --> 00:00:26,100
Going back, as far as I can remember,
it's what I always dreamed of.

10
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:29,440
I think the spark was really lit
when I visited Kennedy Space Center

11
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:33,140
with my family and came home
with a bunch of posters that then went up

12
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:37,067
on the walls of my bedroom and became
the things that I dreamed of from then on.

13
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:38,837
When I think about the Artemis II crew,

14
00:00:38,837 --> 00:00:42,067
my first thought is that I am
so privileged to be a part of it.

15
00:00:42,067 --> 00:00:45,117
These other astronauts
have an amazing history,

16
00:00:45,117 --> 00:00:48,333
amazing record, amazing experience,
and they're great people.

17
00:00:48,333 --> 00:00:50,197
I've known them all for many, many years.

18
00:00:50,197 --> 00:00:52,437
I've had a chance to work
with them in different capacities,

19
00:00:52,437 --> 00:00:55,067
and I think our skills
really complement each other.

20
00:00:55,067 --> 00:00:56,937
They all have a military background,

21
00:00:56,937 --> 00:01:00,377
and I come from a more raw,
technical engineering background,

22
00:01:00,377 --> 00:01:03,597
and I think that that complements
one another really well.

23
00:01:03,597 --> 00:01:05,033
I think we'll work together great,

24
00:01:05,033 --> 00:01:09,677
and I hope to be someone on the crew
that really is that engineering expert,

25
00:01:09,677 --> 00:01:12,267
and I hope that that can be the way
that I contribute the most.
